  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Max Power is a latest-generation co-polyester monofilament designed to deliver explosive acceleration and maximum power without sacrificing precise directional control. Its firm, direct response provides clear ball feedback and confident shot placement, making it ideal for advanced players who generate their own racquet-head speed and want a powerful yet predictable stringbed. The 1.20 mm gauge emphasizes acceleration and feel, the 1.25 mm version offers the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version maximizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Max Power 是一款新一代共聚酯单丝球线，核心特点是在提供爆发性加速和强大力量输出的同时，依旧保持优秀的方向控制和直接击球反馈。其偏扎实、清晰的击球感非常适合能够主动制造拍头速度、追求强攻同时不愿牺牲精准度的中高级球员。1.20毫米版本更强调力量、加速与手感；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米则更偏向耐久、稳定和重击表现。"
  },

